# Normalize line endings for all text files to LF in the repository,
# regardless of the OS or editor used to check them out or edit them.
# This repo's committed history is already all-LF; this just makes that
# convention explicit and stops local CRLF drift (e.g. from Notepad or
# PowerShell ISE) from showing up as noisy whole-file diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never subject to line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
